u_id":"0","menu_name":"不感兴趣","menu_items":[{"type":"dislike_cp","name":"不推荐该作者","id":"40033"},{"type":"dislike_content","name":"减少此类内容","id":"40022"}]}],"cp_info":{"tnews_self_made":-1},"extra_property":{},"share_info":{"share_title":"股价一年暴涨2倍！迈为股份两名实控人半月内“精准”套现17亿元离场","share_subtitle":"近一年来股价暴涨超2倍，尤其是近期凭借“太空光伏”概念而站上千亿市值关口的光伏设备龙头企业迈为股份，近日一纸控股股东减持公告，引发市场和投资者关注。             2月13日，迈为股份（3...."},"long_summary":"近一年来股价暴涨超2倍，尤其是近期凭借“太空光伏”概念而站上千亿市值关口的光伏设备龙头企业迈为股份，近日一纸控股股东减持公告，引发市场和投资者关注。两人合计减持套现金额高达17.27亿元。值得关注的是，上述两名控股股东减持股份精准“踩中”公司股价和市值的高位区间。股价行情数据显示，迈为股份本轮上涨始于2025年初，截至本次控股股东减持前，公司股价较2025年初累计涨幅超过200%。在股价经历一轮暴涨之后，实控人选择高位减持离场，难免引发市场对其“精准套现”的质疑。"},{"id":"20260219A05AYQ00","articletype":"0","title":"黑龙江大庆：“磕头机”下的荒原与新城","pic_style":0,"publish_time":"2026-02-19 18:49:29","pic_info":{"big_img":["https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OJ0iXQMbpDgnO4gI22_rZUu0JBY09JBCi0GQUvicff0cEAA_870492/0"],"small_img":["https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OJ0iXQMbpDgnO4gI22_rZUu0JBY09JBCi0GQUvicff0cEAA_294195/0"],"three_img":["https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OJ0iXQMbpDgnO4gI22_rZUu0JBY09JBCi0GQUvicff0cEAA_197130/0"],"ls_img_exp_type":"1","ext":{"196x130":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OJ0iXQMbpDgnO4gI22_rZUu0JBY09JBCi0GQUvicff0cEAA_196130/0","360x240":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OJ0iXQMbpDgnO4gI22_rZUu0JBY09JBCi0GQUvicff0cEAA_360240/0","330x330":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OLfOf-wTbt_mXQ623zo56FA6iMBlXUrZP-wN6nTsbt25sAA_330330/0"},"share_img":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_bt/OZk6OTygTb0O_BN-ES_eLxRros36CzFGTR3-eNoX91zDYAA/0","img_count":11},"link_info":{"share_url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A05AYQ00","url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A05AYQ00","short_url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A05AYQ00","org_url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A05AYQ00"},"media_info":{"chl_id":"1135","chl_name":"经济观察报","icon":"http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/68219713_100100/0","sicon":"http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/68219713_100100/0","mrk":"经济观察报是专注于财经新闻与经济分析的全国性综合财经类媒体。聚焦商道、