模样。高速公路两侧，原本密集的村镇开始疏朗，大片开阔的黑土地向天际铺展开去，偶尔可见三两座抽油机孤零零地立在田野间，红色的“驴头”一起一伏，重复地“叩首”。这里便是大庆了。这座因油而生的城市，处处留着石油的印记。车子驶入让胡路市区，..."},"long_summary":"高速公路两侧，原本密集的村镇开始疏朗，大片开阔的黑土地向天际铺展开去，偶尔可见三两座抽油机孤零零地立在田野间，红色的“驴头”一起一伏，重复地“叩首”。这里便是大庆了。彼时的大庆，“头上青天一顶，脚下荒原一片”。除了以“铁人”命名的街道、小区、学校，还有随处可见的抽油机，当地人管它们叫“磕头机”。他回忆，20上世纪60六十年代，他父亲那一辈人刚来的时候，这周围什么都没有，一眼望去全是荒草，磕头机就在草稞子里自己“磕头”，到了晚上，四周漆黑一片，只有机器的红点一闪一闪。"},{"id":"20260219A05A7600","articletype":"0","title":"消息称Meta重启智能手表项目，“Malibu 2”机型今年内发布","pic_style":0,"publish_time":"2026-02-19 18:45:12","pic_info":{"big_img":["https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OlE4BbpxfDV5FOCA2sgNSE0g-QyBK4SNn6fWsd9gzFHqUAA_870492/0"],"small_img":["https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OlE4BbpxfDV5FOCA2sgNSE0g-QyBK4SNn6fWsd9gzFHqUAA_294195/0"],"three_img":["https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OlE4BbpxfDV5FOCA2sgNSE0g-QyBK4SNn6fWsd9gzFHqUAA_197130/0"],"ls_img_exp_type":"1","ext":{"196x130":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OlE4BbpxfDV5FOCA2sgNSE0g-QyBK4SNn6fWsd9gzFHqUAA_196130/0","360x240":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OlE4BbpxfDV5FOCA2sgNSE0g-QyBK4SNn6fWsd9gzFHqUAA_360240/0","330x330":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OogjqoV-ggoKwaWuGYpN2SXykzc9KJ-XLQk1z24phGnuIAA_330330/0"},"share_img":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OlE4BbpxfDV5FOCA2sgNSE0g-QyBK4SNn6fWsd9gzFHqUAA_870492/0","img_count":1},"link_info":{"share_url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A05A7600","url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A05A7600","short_url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A05A7600","org_url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A05A7600"},"media_info":{"chl_id":"5017062","chl_name":"IT之家","icon":"http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/2234745680_200200/0","sicon":"http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/2234745680_200200/0","mrk":"爱科技，爱这里 - 前沿科技人气平台","last_art_update":"0","uin":"ecac27dd1393e2bc67","encoded_suid":"8QMc3H1e5IMcuQ==","vip_type":"30012","vip_type_new":"30012","vip_desc":"IT之家官方账号","vip_icon":"http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876051701/0","medal_info":{"type_id":27,"medal_id":41,"medal_l