，明确了硬件产品线的长期规划。公司将重新启动智能手表，以与苹果Apple Watch、三星Galaxy Watch以及谷歌Pixel Watch等竞品展开正面竞争。"},{"id":"20260219A058UY00","articletype":"0","title":"当流量退潮，民营银行为何“消失”在TOP50？","pic_style":0,"publish_time":"2026-02-19 18:37:35","pic_info":{"big_img":["https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O-EPb_JubGUd7nGIEe5TebU7AehnzehG7g1dj-fddQlesAA_870492/0"],"small_img":["https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O-EPb_JubGUd7nGIEe5TebU7AehnzehG7g1dj-fddQlesAA_294195/0"],"three_img":["https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O-EPb_JubGUd7nGIEe5TebU7AehnzehG7g1dj-fddQlesAA_197130/0"],"ls_img_exp_type":"1","ext":{"196x130":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O-EPb_JubGUd7nGIEe5TebU7AehnzehG7g1dj-fddQlesAA_196130/0","360x240":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O-EPb_JubGUd7nGIEe5TebU7AehnzehG7g1dj-fddQlesAA_360240/0","330x330":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OhyxIZB_rVErmK3S85pdhjLPrIqfOrNnky6V5p2SkBJk8AA_330330/0"},"share_img":"https://inews.gtimg.com/news_bt/OpXAFY-NuSrK9BUHUGf6M4bDKDQY7SCQgSpGDGAHXk3QcAA/0","img_count":1},"link_info":{"share_url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A058UY00","url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A058UY00","short_url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A058UY00","org_url":"https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260219A058UY00"},"media_info":{"chl_id":"1135","chl_name":"经济观察报","icon":"http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/68219713_100100/0","sicon":"http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/68219713_100100/0","mrk":"经济观察报是专注于财经新闻与经济分析的全国性综合财经类媒体。聚焦商道、商技和商机，以锐度、悦读、广度的报道形成了权威的媒体公信力和影响力。","last_art_update":"0","encoded_suid":"8QMf2nlY7YUevTbQ","vip_type":"30013","vip_type_new":"30013","vip_desc":"经济观察报官方账号","vip_icon":"http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876049251/0","medal_info":{"type_id":31,"medal_id":45,"medal_level":1,"medal_name":"别具慧眼","medal_desc":"成为荐评手，一起建设腾讯新闻社区！","night_url":"https://new.inews.gtimg.com/tnews/8c3d00f9/7f36/8c3d00f9-7f36-44a9-82c4-be357b54fe9b.png","daytime_url":"https://new.inews.gtimg.com/tnews/45af77fe/a73d/45af77fe-a73d-42d2-ab80-feaa383611de.png"}},"interation_info":